            <note corresp="#d198-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d198-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Kennedy Library, National Security Files, Trips and Conference Series
                    Taylor Trip. Secret; Eyes Only. The source text bears the notation, “Cable for
                    dispatch via State Department.” No other copy of this message has been
                    found.</p>
            </note>
